{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The key constraint is \"translated into over twenty five languages\" combined with an award created in the 2000s. Let me think about the Man Booker International Prize - it was created in 2004/2005. Let me look at the puzzle structure more carefully.\n\nThe puzzle: A book (Book A) was a contender for an award. The award itself was created in the 2000s. Book A was translated into over 25 languages. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won the award. Book B had been released the preceding year. The author of Book B was born in the same city where the author of Book A grew up.\n\nLet me reconsider. The Man Booker International Prize was created in 2004 (first awarded 2005). Let me look at the International Booker Prize winners in the 2010s and find a book translated into 25+ languages.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize winners 2010s list\", \"Man Booker International Prize 2016 2017 2018 2019 winner shortlist\", \"book translated 25 languages shortlisted International Booker Prize\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_df97492883bd4777aedb7969","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The Labyrinth of the Spirits Isabel Allende translated languages\", \"Isabel Allende born Lima Peru\", \"Isabel Allende birthplace biography\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_4e661ade900b4b318c84aa3c","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789467514,"id":"chatcmpl-e76ef9b3-485c-9656-b4b6-bdc592ee1092","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":14176,"completion_tokens":306,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":14482,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}